<title>HONG KONG: HK dlr, money market quiet ahead of FOMC, IPO.</title>
<headline>HK dlr, money market quiet ahead of FOMC, IPO.</headline>
<text>
<p>USD/JPY  113.38/43   OVERNIGHT 4.38   3MO  HKD/USD DEPOSIT  +73</p>
<p>USD/DEM  1.6957/69   3MO SWAP  65     2YR  HKD/USD SPREAD   -02</p>
<p>USD/HKD  7.7387/97   6MO SWAP  85     10YR HKD/USD SPREAD   +62</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>* Hong Kong dollar flat and steady but market extremely quiet in advance of Federal Open Market Committee meeting in the United States</p>
<p>* Opinion evenly divided on whether U.S. will raise rates, players sticking to the sidelines until decision announced  </p>
<p>* Market nervous about HK$100 billion initial public offering Beijing Enterprises, which rumoured to be 1,000-times over-subscribed</p>
<p>* Notes and bills quiet on rate jitters</p>
<p>* EFN yields: 3yr 6.46 pct, 5yr 6.87 pct, 7yr 7.09 pct, one week 5.48 pct</p>
<p>-- Sarah Davison (852) 2843 6470</p>
</text>
